{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The memory card and USB reader bundle partly fits because the reader connects to a computer for a practical transfer task, much like my past connection accessories.",
    "That partial match does not mean I would choose it now: I would need a specific reason to transfer memory cards."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo speakers, Fire TV devices and Echo Auto serve voice-assistant or entertainment needs that my recent purchases do not suggest.",
    "The smart plug and camera assume home-automation or monitoring needs I do not currently have.",
    "The standalone memory cards offer storage, but I have not shown a need for more card storage or identified a device that needs them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning computer accessories seems to have been treated as interest in electronic gadgets generally.",
    "Several widely purchased Alexa and streaming devices appeared even though their popularity gives me no practical reason to choose them."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My WiFi adapter, USB expansion card, display cable and Ethernet adapter point toward connecting equipment and adding useful ports.",
    "My interactions are infrequent and spread over years, so a related accessory alone is not enough to suggest I need another purchase now.",
    "Compatibility and a specific task matter to me more than whether an item broadly resembles other electronics I have used."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized a broad interest in electronics but missed my more specific, occasional need for practical computer connections and accessories."
}"}
